This product includes AgentSim, a modular agentic simulation framework
(the `agentsim/` package), vendored and adapted for this kit.

The question sets and document corpora under data/questions/ are derived from
third-party datasets and keep their own licenses; each dataset's manifest records
its source, homepage and license:

  HotpotQA          CC BY-SA 4.0    https://hotpotqa.github.io/
  2WikiMultihopQA   Apache-2.0      https://github.com/Alab-NII/2wikimultihop
  MuSiQue           CC BY 4.0       https://github.com/StonyBrookNLP/musique
  StrategyQA        MIT             https://allenai.org/data/strategyqa

The teacher-guided episodes under data/episodes/ were generated by running the
models named in each record's student_model and teacher_models_used fields.
